  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Thematic Bond Program with the Stock Exchanges of Colombia, Paraguay and Peru</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project provides demand-led technical assistance to the Colombia Stock Exchange (BVC), the Lima Stock Exchange (BVL), and the Asuncion Stock and Products Exchange (BVPASA) to complete five thematic bonds issuances to raise capital (at least US$ 400 million) earmarked to green and social projects contributing to the countries&#xB4; climate change ambitions and post-COVID recovery</narrative>
  </description>
